Runtime dependencies
--------------------
- jMRTD (org.jmrtd:jmrtd)                 — LGPL-2.1-or-later
     e-passport (ICAO 9303) BAC/PACE + data-group parsing.
- SCUBA (net.sf.scuba:scuba-sc-android)   — LGPL-2.1-or-later
    smartcard / IsoDep card service used by jMRTD.
- Bouncy Castle (org.bouncycastle:bcprov-jdk18on, bcpkix-jdk18on)
                                          — Bouncy Castle License (MIT-style)
    crypto provider: RSA/ECDSA passive auth, CMS, X.509, EC curve math.

LGPL note: jMRTD and SCUBA are LGPL. This project is AGPL-3.0 (LGPL-compatible).
Recipients may replace those libraries with compatible versions; they are used as
libraries and not modified in this repository.

